OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was found dead in a bin bag
OL,7,Fin a park was aged between 60 and 80
OL,8,Fand was malnourished, detectives have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FA murder inquiry was launched after the
OL,12,Fwoman's body was discovered in Stanley
OL,13,FPark in Anfield, Liverpool on 28
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FA month on, Merseyside Police, who have
OL,17,Fnot disclosed the cause of the woman's
OL,18,Fdeath, said the victim had no teeth and
OL,19,Fhad several medical conditions
OL,20,Fincluding Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary
OL,21,FDisease (COPD).
