OL,6,FDet Supt Rachel Wilson appealed for the
OL,7,Fpublic's help, adding: "We are really
OL,8,Fkeen on identifying her and giving her
OL,9,Fa name as she has been the victim of a
OL,10,Fhorrendous murder."
